---
description: Install bun packages with exact pinned versions
globs: "**/package.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Exact Dependency Versions

Pin exact versions when adding or updating dependencies. Never use ranges (`^`, `~`, `>=`, `*`) or `latest`.

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
bun add react@19.1.0
bun add -d vitest@3.2.4

# ❌ BAD — writes a range into package.json
bun add react
bun add react@latest
bun add react@^19.1.0
```

After installing, confirm `package.json` entries are exact semver strings (`"1.2.3"`), matching the rest of this repo.
